#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:445
msgid "Repeated Calls Bypass"
msgstr "Zaobilaženje ponovljenih poziva"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:282
msgid "If the same number calls 3 times in 5 minutes, force max volume."
msgstr ""
"Ako isti broj zove 3 puta u 5 minuta, forsirajte maksimalnu jačinu zvuka."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:297
msgid "Manage contacts that always play sound"
msgstr "Upravljajte kontaktima koji uvijek puštaju zvuk"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:306
#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:318
#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:329
msgid "Manage"
msgstr "Upravljaj"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:316
msgid "Set custom notification sounds for specific contacts"
msgstr "Postavite prilagođene zvukove obavijesti za određene kontakte"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:327
msgid "Set custom ringtones for specific contacts"
msgstr "Postavite prilagođene melodije zvona za određene kontakte"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Zadani kod zemlje se koristi za formatiranje brojeva koji ne sadrže "
"međunarodni prefiks (npr. +358).\n"
"\n"
"Ako ostavite prazno, sistem pokušava da ga automatski otkrije sa vaše SIM "
"kartice ili mreže.\n"
"\n"
"Ovdje ga možete ručno zamijeniti unosom dvoslovnog ISO koda regije (npr. US, "
"FI, DE) ili pozivnog koda (npr. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:373
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Ton povratnog zvona je zvuk koji se reprodukuje (tut-tut-tut) dok se čeka da "
"se odgovori na odlazni poziv. Neki operateri ga ne generiraju pa imamo "
"opciju da ga ručno generiramo ovdje. \n"
"\n"
"Možete odabrati sopstvenu muzičku datoteku ili je izbrisati da biste "
"koristili standardni sistemski ton."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:393
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Odaberite Ton povratnog zvona"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:401
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Audio datoteke"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:427
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite adresare koje ćete koristiti s Telefonijom i rasporedite ih po "
"prioritetu. Najviši adresar ima najveći prioritet i bit će poželjan ako se "
"broj nalazi u više adresara. Možete koristiti prekidač Duplicate Resolver u "
"nastavku da biste lakše upravljali duplikatima, ali čak i ako je "
"onemogućeno, preporučujemo da ga omogućite za bolje iskustvo."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:446
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, ako vas isti telefonski broj pozove 3 puta u roku od 5 "
"minuta, treći poziv (i naredni u okviru prozora) će primorati telefon da "
"zvoni maksimalnom jačinom, zaobilazeći nečujni ili Ne ometaj režime."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:458
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite kontakte koji će uvijek reproducirati obavještenja punom jačinom, "
"čak i kada je telefon u nečujnom ili Ne ometaj modu."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:479
msgid "Unknown Callers"
msgstr "Nepoznati pozivaoci"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:484
msgid "Unknown Callers Action"
msgstr "Radnja nepoznatih pozivatelja"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:486
msgid "Applies also to hidden numbers."
msgstr "Odnosi se i na skrivene brojeve."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Ne radi ništa"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:490
msgid "Block Completely"
msgstr "Blokiraj potpuno"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:491
msgid "Silence and Hide UI"
msgstr "Silence and Hide UI"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:492
msgid "Silence Only"
msgstr "Samo tišina"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:500
msgid "Add Search button to InCall window and Call History for unknown callers"
msgstr ""
"Dodajte dugme za pretragu u prozor InCall i istoriju poziva za nepoznate "
"pozivaoce"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:506
msgid "Search Engine"
msgstr "Search Engine"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:510
#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:515
msgid "Custom URL"
msgstr "Prilagođeni URL"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:565
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"Unesite URL koji želite koristiti za pretraživanje nepoznatih brojeva. "
"Uključite ' {number} ' u URL na koji treba da ide telefonski broj "
"pozivaoca.\n"
"\n"
"Na primjer: https://mysearch.com/?q= {number} Kada dodirnete dugme za "
"pretragu tokom poziva, zamenit ćemo ' {number} ' stvarnim telefonskim brojem "
"i otvoriti ga u vašem podrazumevanom pretraživaču."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:569
msgid "Custom Search URL"
msgstr "URL prilagođenog pretraživanja"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:590
msgid "Desktop Shortcuts"
msgstr "Desktop Shortcuts"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:595
msgid "Calls"
msgstr "Pozivi"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:761
msgid "Name (e.g. Mom)"
msgstr "Ime (npr. mama)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:811
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je jačina zvuka poziva za svaki izlaz. Nivo se primjenjuje automatski "
"kada se poziv poveže i kad god se izlaz promijeni tokom poziva, a promjene "
"klizača se odmah čuju. Hardver primjenjuje nivoe u krupnim koracima, a "
"slušalica nikada ne utihne potpuno. Nivo za Bluetooth se pohranjuje za "
"buduću podršku rutiranja."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:820
msgid "Decline Message"
msgstr "Odbij poruku"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:891
msgid "System Default (Always Enabled)"
msgstr "Sistemski zadani (uvijek omogućen)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:902
msgid "Personal Address Book"
msgstr "Lični adresar"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:903
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced to Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je adresar koji će biti sinhronizovan sa Andromedom ako to odaberete u "
"sistemskim postavkama."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:911
msgid "Andromeda Contacts"
msgstr "Andromeda Contacts"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:912
msgid ""
"This is the address book that will be synced from Andromeda if you choose to "
"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je adresar koji će biti sinhronizovan sa Andromede ako to odaberete u "
"sistemskim postavkama."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1037
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "Postavke sačuvane"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:40
msgid "Voice Message"
msgstr "Glasovna poruka"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:91
msgid "Tap to Record"
msgstr "Dodirnite za snimanje"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:137
msgid "Attach Voice Note"
msgstr "Priložite glasovnu bilješku"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/sound_recorder_window.py:224
msgid "Recording is too large for MMS (Max 600KB). Please Retake shorter."
msgstr "Snimak je prevelik za MMS (maks. 600 KB). Ponovo polagajte kraće."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:141
msgid "Enable Feature"
msgstr "Omogući funkciju"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:170
msgid ""
"Contacts can trigger an action by sending a secret SMS message. Add contacts "
"below and set their secret trigger phrase."
msgstr ""
"Kontakti mogu pokrenuti radnju slanjem tajne SMS poruke. Dodajte kontakte "
"ispod i postavite njihovu tajnu frazu okidača."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:173
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can request your location by sending a secret SMS message. "
"TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and set their "
"secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: "
"'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Pouzdani kontakti mogu zatražiti vašu lokaciju slanjem tajne SMS poruke. "
"TOTP je obavezan da bi ova funkcija radila. Dodajte kontakte ispod i "
"postavite njihovu tajnu frazu okidača. Primjer šablona: 'SECRET TOTP' "
"Stvarni primjer: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:176
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can silently trigger a callback by sending a secret SMS "
"message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to work. Add contacts below and "
"set their secret trigger phrase. Example template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Pouzdani kontakti mogu tiho pokrenuti povratni poziv slanjem tajne SMS "
"poruke. TOTP je obavezan da bi ova funkcija radila. Dodajte kontakte ispod i "
"postavite njihovu tajnu frazu okidača. Primjer šablona: 'SECRET TOTP' "
"Stvarni primjer: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:179
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can send an SMS relay. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Pouzdani kontakti mogu poslati SMS relej. TOTP je obavezan da bi ova "
"funkcija radila. Dodajte kontakte ispod i postavite njihovu tajnu frazu "
"okidača. Primjer šablona: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Stvarni primjer: "
"'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Hello'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:182
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can start a tmate SSH session and receive the SSH access "
"string by sending a secret SMS message. TOTP is mandatory for this feature "
"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Pouzdani kontakti mogu započeti tmate SSH sesiju i primiti SSH pristupni niz "
"slanjem tajne SMS poruke. TOTP je obavezan da bi ova funkcija radila. "
"Dodajte kontakte ispod i postavite njihovu tajnu frazu okidača. Primjer "
"šablona: 'SECRET TOTP' Stvarni primjer: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:185
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Pouzdani kontakti mogu obrisati vaš uređaj. TOTP je obavezan da bi ova "
"funkcija radila. Dodajte kontakte ispod i postavite njihovu tajnu frazu "
"okidača. Primjer šablona: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN "
"SUDO_PASSWORD' Stvarni primjer: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 "
"SupportYourLocalFootball'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:284
msgid "View or edit TOTP"
msgstr "Pogledaj ili uredi TOTP"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:286
msgid "Setup TOTP"
msgstr "Postavi TOTP"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:356
msgid "Secret message"
msgstr "Tajna poruka"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:368
msgid "Remove Contact"
msgstr "Ukloni kontakt"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:392
msgid "Contact removed (Click Save to commit)"
msgstr "Kontakt je uklonjen (kliknite na Sačuvaj da biste se obavezali)"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:526
msgid "Contact already in trusted list"
msgstr "Kontakt koji je već na listi pouzdanih"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:540
msgid "Contact added"
msgstr "Kontakt je dodan"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:558
msgid "TOTP Setup"
msgstr "Postavke TOTP-a"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:604
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Podijelite ovaj kod sa svojim pouzdanim kontaktom. Trebali bi ga dodati u "
"aplikaciju za autentifikaciju kao što je Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Ako unosite ručno, osigurajte sljedeće postavke:\n"
"• Algoritam: SHA1\n"
"• Broj cifara: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 sekundi\n"
"\n"
"Svaka akcija ima svoj vlastiti kod. Kada pokreću akciju putem SMS-a, moraju "
"dodati trenutni šestocifreni kod iz svog autentifikatora nakon ključne "
"riječi."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:633
msgid "Copy TOTP key"
msgstr "Kopiraj TOTP ključ"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:644
#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:686
msgid "Regenerate"
msgstr "Ponovo generiraj"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:651
msgid "Remove current TOTP"
msgstr "Ukloni trenutni TOTP"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:660
msgid "Remove TOTP Key?"
msgstr "Ukloniti TOTP ključ?"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:661
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the TOTP key? This action will disable TOTP "
"verification for this feature."
msgstr ""
"Jeste li sigurni da želite ukloniti TOTP ključ? Ova radnja će onemogućiti "
"TOTP verifikaciju za ovu funkciju."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:681
msgid "Regenerate Code?"
msgstr "Ponovo generirati kod?"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:682
msgid ""
"This will invalidate the current code in your contact's authenticator app. "
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"Ovo će poništiti trenutni kod u aplikaciji za autentifikaciju vašeg "
"kontakta. Jeste li sigurni?"

